===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|enquery}}, from the {{der|en|fro|-}} verb {{m|fro|enquerre}}, from {{der|en|la|inquīrō}}, composed of {{m|la|in-||in, at, on; into}} + {{m|la|quaerō||to seek, look for}}, of uncertain origin, but possibly from {{der|en|itc-pro|*kʷaizeō}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*kʷeh₂-||to acquire}}. Later respelled to conform to the original Latin spelling, as opposed to the Old French spelling.

===Pronunciation===
